# Every folder under maps/ is generated (tools/mapgen suites under maps/suites/fresh/, symlink sets over them for A/Bs under maps/suites/merged/; maps/SUITES.md indexes them):
# regenerate from their seeds (tools/README.md). Only the folders below are tracked; new top-level
# ladder maps still show up. A/B sets (maps/suites/merged/) and their seeds, for reference:
#   osc-fix-10k: fresh-88001..88020; osc-fix-20k: fresh-88001..88040
#   osc-r2-10k: fresh-91021..91040; osc-r2-20k: those and fresh-99101..99120
#   final-30k: fresh-99121..99237 (final check of the oscillation work)
#   noveto-20k: fresh-99238..99277; noveto2-20k: fresh-99278..99317; noveto3-20k: fresh-99318..99357
#   osc3-confirm: mapgen seeds 3391-3410; osc4-*: stream 4's shared-gems and Monolith test sets
#   p1a-b1..b6: fresh-147001..147120; p1b-*: fresh-148001..148180 (20 suites a set; EXPERIMENTS "Phase 1a/1b")
#   p2-*: phase 2 bundle sets (EXPERIMENTS "Phase 2")
maps/*/
!maps/fall-custom/
!maps/gen-bench/

# Local oarena (github.com/frkns/local-oarena): its checkout, launcher and state; big-arm runs the team's
local-oarena/
/arena
.oarena/

